<Base title="Refund policy" description="Refunds for the $49 Industry spotlight: full refund before it goes live, and a full refund within the first 7 days after it goes live. One-time payment, no auto-renewal.">
  <article class="wrap prose page-intro legal">
    <h1>Refund policy</h1>
    <p class="note">Last updated: November 13, 2026</p>

    <h2 id="spotlight">Industry spotlight ($49)</h2>
    <p>The <a href="/get-featured/">Industry spotlight</a> puts you in the top spot on one industry page for 30 days, labeled Sponsored. There is no contract. You pay once through a Stripe Payment Link.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Before it goes live:</strong> full refund, any time.</li>
      <li><strong>First 7 days after it goes live:</strong> if you're not happy, full refund, no questions asked.</li>
      <li><strong>After day 7:</strong> no partial refunds. The spotlight runs its full 30 days.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The spotlight does not renew automatically. It is a one-time payment.</p>

    <h2 id="how">How to ask for a refund</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:timothy@aiphonecompare.com?subject=Refund">timothy@aiphonecompare.com</a> from the address you paid with. The refund goes back to your original card through Stripe. It usually takes 5–10 business days to show up, depending on your bank.</p>

    <h2 id="removal">If we remove a spotlight</h2>
    <p>We may remove a spotlight that is misleading. If we do, we refund it in full.</p>

    <h2 id="done-for-you">Done-for-you setup guarantee</h2>
    <p>This section applies only to the done-for-you setup service, once it is offered. Its exact terms will be listed here when it launches.</p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about refunds: <a href="mailto:timothy@aiphonecompare.com">timothy@aiphonecompare.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
